      en: ["The cathedral was constructed in 1874 on the site of a previous chapel.", "One of the most extensive renovations of the building occurred between 1993 and 1994.", "Felix Paul, the first native Bishop, was interred here in 2001.", "The building is considered the largest Catholic church in the Seychelles archipelago.", "The design blends classical colonial elements with local construction materials.", "The cathedral is located near the iconic Victoria Clock Tower (Lorloz)."],
