      en: ["The building was constructed in 1910 using a grant of £1,750 sterling.", "It was the first public library established in the Seychelles.", "Andrew Carnegie funded over 2,500 libraries worldwide, including this one in Victoria.", "Until 1990, the building served as the repository for the National Archives.", "The official opening ceremony took place on January 22, 1910.", "It is located on Victoria Street, near the Cathedral of the Immaculate Conception."],
