      en: ["The house was constructed around 1900 for the wealthy resident Eustache Sarde.", "It is built almost entirely of timber and rests on stone supports.", "The elevated pillar design is a traditional method for passive cooling in tropical climates.", "The building is situated in the Anse Réunion area on La Digue Island.", "It has been officially registered as a national monument of the Seychelles.", "Much of the original decorative woodwork on the exterior remains intact today."],
