      en: ["Grann Kaz was originally built in the 19th century as the center of a plantation estate.", "The name literally translates to 'Big House' in the local Seychellois Creole language.", "The walls are partially constructed from fossilized coral blocks.", "Frégate Island was historically associated with pirates such as Olivier Levasseur.", "The building has undergone extensive restoration to serve as a luxury venue.", "It houses a collection of historical records detailing the island's unique flora and fauna."],
